<title>NETHERLANDS: HEINEKEN FIRST HALF NET UP 6 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>HEINEKEN FIRST HALF NET UP 6 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.92 vs   5.59</p>
<p>    Net profit			   297    vs 280.0</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (guilders)	1.50 vs   1.50</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  5.92 vs   4.93</p>
<p>    Trading profit		     464    vs 431</p>
<p>Note - Heineken was expected by analysts to produce a net</p>
<p>profit between 308 and 322 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Profit of nonconsolidated cies   36    vs  18</p>
<p>    Interest charges			8    vs  13.6 gain</p>
<p>    Pretax profit on ordinary ops   492    vs 463</p>
<p>    Tax				     181    vs 175.6</p>
<p>    Minorities interests		 14    vs   7</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
